{"title":"Mountain Ogre","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>149</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>310</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>31</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>199</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>428</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>343</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>88</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>28</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>149</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>310</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>31</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>199</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>428</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>343</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>88</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></t